      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY JULIA (3) has missed the frame at last two runs but could not have been more impressive the run prior in her solid 17.46 win at this track over 300m. Smart win three back and looks a key chance here. WHISKEY AGOGO (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (18.14) in a Grade 5 at this track. Some good form is emerging from her last run. One of the better chances. RED BROOK (5) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (17.86) there the start prior. Expected to run well. KIARNI BAD GIRL (2) has been in the frame at her last two runs, most recently when third (22.60) in a Grade 4/5 over 400m at Maitland. Something for the Multiples: KEYLIN (6)",
